        "LCM of 3 and 4 is 12",
        "4/12 + 3/12 = 7/12"
      ],
      "answer": "7/12",
      "commonMistake": "3⁻¹ + 4⁻¹ = 7⁻¹ — exponents cannot combine across addition."
    },
    {
      "problemId": "ex2_1_q2_ii",
      "question": "Find the value of (3⁰ + 4⁻¹) × 2².",
